      "Kruskal-Wallis test: does metal significantly affect ΔG‡?\n",
      "  H = 3.464,  p = 1.7691e-01\n",
      "  → No significant metal effect detected\n",
      "\n",
      "Do Mn(CO)₃ complexes access different distance ranges than Fe/Ru-Cp?\n",
      "  Mn(CO)₃  distances:  4.91 ± 1.78 Å\n",
      "  Fe/Ru-Cp distances:  4.71 ± 1.70 Å\n",
      "  Mann-Whitney U = 403.5,  p = 1.5550e-01\n",
      "  → No significant difference in distance ranges\n",
      "\n",
      "Partial correlation (ΔG‡ ~ distance, controlling for metal):\n",
      "  Partial r = 0.8326,  p = 2.4658e-25\n",
      "  → Distance effect on ΔG‡ persists even after removing metal variation\n",
      "\n",
      "Stratified linear regression (slope of ΔG‡ ~ distance per metal):\n",
      "  Fe   slope=+2.619  R²=0.679  p=0.000\n",
      "  Ru   slope=+3.760  R²=0.790  p=0.000\n",
